WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.490
Now, I know that you're a big,

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.480
you're a beer aficionado.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.313
Is that true?
Somewhat, yeah.

00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:06.272
You like your beer?

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.105
(crowd cheering)

00:00:07.105 --> 00:00:08.503
You've incorporated it into your...

00:00:09.536 --> 00:00:10.369
Into your character.

00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:13.535
I have been known to sip
an occasional beverage.

00:00:13.535 --> 00:00:14.730
(audience laughter)

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.700
You like the beer, you like--

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.533
Yeah, I dig beer.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:18.719
We had--

00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:19.552
(audience laughter)

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.385
we brought you some beer here,

00:00:20.385 --> 00:00:21.218
'cause I thought we'd want you to--

00:00:21.218 --> 00:00:22.051
(audience cheering)

00:00:22.051 --> 00:00:22.884
But you were--

00:00:22.884 --> 00:00:24.310
You guys making me, I feel right at home.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.506
Yeah, I wanted you to
feel comfortable here.

00:00:25.506 --> 00:00:26.339
Appreciate it.

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:27.470
I wanted you to drink a lot and then

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.838
I would beat you senseless.

00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:29.790
(laughter)

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.300
I just fight pretty good drunk, yeah.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.133
Oh, okay well.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:32.966
I got that goin' for me too.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.410
I'm no good either way.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.480
Multi-faceted over here.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.660
So I thought maybe you could show us,

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.500
'cause you're very
imaginative and colorful

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.540
in the way that you drink beer.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.006
Maybe you could
demonstrate for Andy and I.

00:00:43.006 --> 00:00:44.070
(audience cheering)

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.097
By the way, there you go, want some?

00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:48.434
(audience cheering)

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.744
It's the only way to drink beer.

00:00:49.744 --> 00:00:52.744
(audience cheering)

00:00:54.424 --> 00:00:56.244
Well, if I'm drinking,
you gotta drink too.

00:00:56.244 --> 00:00:57.077
Yeah, yeah, all right.

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:58.144
There you go.

00:00:58.144 --> 00:00:58.980
Let's go, and what do we do?

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.124
You open it up.

00:01:00.124 --> 00:01:01.400
You know how to open that beer, don't you?

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.930
Mm-hmm, yeah, I do.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.609
I will need a straw though.

00:01:04.609 --> 00:01:07.625
(laughter)

00:01:07.625 --> 00:01:08.530
There you go.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.053
Okay, just one, or are you--

00:01:10.053 --> 00:01:10.886
All right, now show us what to do.

00:01:10.886 --> 00:01:12.980
Well of course you gotta
crash 'em together.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:13.813
What do you mean?

00:01:13.813 --> 00:01:14.646
Someone could get hurt.

00:01:14.646 --> 00:01:17.060
No, you just gotta take a firm hold on it.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:17.893
A little bit, yeah, about like that.

00:01:17.893 --> 00:01:19.618
I like that, and you go like what?

00:01:19.618 --> 00:01:20.451
Ready?

00:01:20.451 --> 00:01:21.467
(beer cans crashing)

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:24.467
(audience cheering)

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:31.358
Something like that?

00:01:31.358 --> 00:01:32.941
Aww no, no, no, no.

00:01:34.516 --> 00:01:36.743
That's not gonna cut it.

00:01:36.743 --> 00:01:38.771
(audience cheering)

00:01:38.771 --> 00:01:41.421
If you're gonna go, no.

00:01:41.421 --> 00:01:43.522
(audience cheering)

00:01:43.522 --> 00:01:44.968
I have my own method.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.597
We're going to do the Stone
Cold 101 on beer drinking.

00:01:46.597 --> 00:01:48.650
All right, what do you do?

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.910
You slam it again, and
this time, and then I get--

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.110
We've already slammed,
we've already done that,

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:53.220
so now we're just drinking.

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.650
Okay, and do you just literally just

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.320
pour it into your mouth?

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.667
Yeah, you gotta swallow a few times now.

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:01.064
(audience laughing)

00:02:01.064 --> 00:02:03.077
(Conan clears throat)

00:02:03.077 --> 00:02:04.686
(audience cheering)

00:02:04.686 --> 00:02:06.513
All right, all right, now.

00:02:06.513 --> 00:02:07.593
You're sitting over there,

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:10.153
you're not gonna sit
over there and get away.

00:02:10.153 --> 00:02:11.725
You're drinking beer with us, right?

00:02:11.725 --> 00:02:14.160
All right, all right, here we go.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.155
You gotta give it a shot.

00:02:15.155 --> 00:02:18.155
(audience cheering)

00:02:21.465 --> 00:02:24.711
There you go, look at
that, a beer-drinker.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.431
Now, you did that well,

00:02:26.431 --> 00:02:28.260
but you gotta get a little distance.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.211
Now, what's the next one?

00:02:29.211 --> 00:02:31.070
Well, you're drinkin' beer, come on now,

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.421
you impressed me with the first one.

00:02:32.421 --> 00:02:33.254
(audience laughing)

00:02:33.254 --> 00:02:34.677
Anybody can get lucky.

00:02:34.677 --> 00:02:37.411
I love it, you don't have
to twist his arm, Steve.

00:02:37.411 --> 00:02:38.741
He'd been waiting for
me to come on this show.

00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:41.311
Oh, I don't know, oh, all right.

00:02:41.311 --> 00:02:44.300
All right, so you're in an
arena full of 20,000 people,

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.490
the building is sold out,

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.730
you're right in the center of the ring.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:48.890
Well, it's easy to drink
beer for the first row,

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.600
but you gotta drink beer for the last row.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.433
[Conan] Right.

00:02:51.433 --> 00:02:52.266
So that's why you gotta get that extension

00:02:52.266 --> 00:02:53.370
in there with the arm.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.500
And if you stand up, it's
easier for the beer to go down.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.333
So we stand up--

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:57.166
So you'd be standing up.

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.415
All right.

00:02:58.415 --> 00:02:59.438
(audience cheering)

00:02:59.438 --> 00:03:01.439
Okay, very good, you doing.

00:03:01.439 --> 00:03:03.022
And go, how high?

00:03:03.897 --> 00:03:06.897
(audience cheering)

00:03:10.362 --> 00:03:11.362
Beautiful.

00:03:15.846 --> 00:03:17.586
How do you feel?

00:03:17.586 --> 00:03:19.315
No, how do you feel?

00:03:19.315 --> 00:03:20.648
How do you feel?

00:03:22.126 --> 00:03:22.959
Good.

00:03:22.959 --> 00:03:23.792
You all right?

00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:24.625
Yeah.

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:25.507
You ready for the salute?

00:03:25.507 --> 00:03:26.340
Yeah.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.173
Are you?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:29.914
What's the salute?

00:03:29.914 --> 00:03:30.778
Middle fingers.

00:03:30.778 --> 00:03:32.080
No, we're not gonna, come on.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.705
Oh, how you doin' over there?

00:03:33.705 --> 00:03:34.538
I have some old ladies
that watch this show.

00:03:34.538 --> 00:03:36.524
I'm doing, oh, all right, here we go.

00:03:36.524 --> 00:03:39.155
(audience cheering)

00:03:39.155 --> 00:03:40.818
This guy's a real drinker already.

00:03:40.818 --> 00:03:42.485
(Conan laughs)

00:03:42.485 --> 00:03:43.937
Does he just do this job on the side?

00:03:43.937 --> 00:03:45.210
Or what's the deal there?

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.174
[Conan] Oh, he's got a problem.

00:03:46.174 --> 00:03:48.424
(laughter)

